        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    %% ==========================================\n    %% AI-DRIVEN API TEST GENERATOR (HW06 - ESHOP)\n    %% Sơ đồ kiến trúc rút gọn - Dễ vẽ lại bằng tay\n    %% ==========================================\n\n    %% 1. INPUT\n    subgraph Inputs [\&quot;1. Input Data\&quot;]\n        Spec[\&quot;API Specification\\n(api_specification.md)\&quot;]\n        Reqs[\&quot;Requirements &amp; Security\\n(FR-01..19, SEC-01..07)\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    %% 2. AI GENERATOR ENGINE\n    subgraph Generator [\&quot;2. AI Test Generator (api-test-case-generator)\&quot;]\n        Parser[\&quot;Spec &amp; Rule Parser\&quot;]\n        \n        subgraph Rounds [\&quot;4-Round Generation\&quot;]\n            R1[\&quot;Round 1: Domain Partitioning (BVA/EP)\&quot;]\n            R2[\&quot;Round 2: State Transitions (FR-10)\&quot;]\n            R3[\&quot;Round 3: Security Rules (SEC-01..07)\&quot;]\n            R4[\&quot;Round 4: Schema Validation\&quot;]\n        end\n\n        Dedup[\&quot;Deduplication &amp; Coverage Check (&gt;= 35 cases)\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    %% 3. HUMAN GATE\n    subgraph HumanGate [\&quot;3. Human Quality Gate\&quot;]\n        Review[\&quot;Human Review\\n(VALID / INVALID / INCOMPLETE)\&quot;]\n        Extend[\&quot;Human Extension\\n(Bổ sung &gt;= 5 test cases)\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    %% 4. EXECUTION &amp; CI/CD\n    subgraph Execution [\&quot;4. Execution &amp; Defect Triage\&quot;]\n        Postman[\&quot;Postman Collection\\n(Inject Header X-Student-Id)\&quot;]\n        Newman[\&quot;Newman CLI Runner\\n(HTML Extra Report)\&quot;]\n        BugReport[\&quot;Bug Reporter\\n(GitHub Issues)\&quot;]\n        CICD[\&quot;GitHub Actions CI/CD\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    %% 5. AI AUDIT\n    subgraph Audit [\&quot;5. AI Audit System\&quot;]\n        AuditLog[\&quot;AI Audit Log &amp; Critique\\n(ai-audit-report)\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    %% ==========================================\n    %% FLOWS\n    %% ==========================================\n    Spec --&gt; Parser\n    Reqs --&gt; Parser\n\n    Parser --&gt; R1\n    R1 --&gt; R2\n    R2 --&gt; R3\n    R3 --&gt; R4\n    R4 --&gt; Dedup\n\n    Dedup --&gt; Review\n    Review --&gt; Extend\n    Extend --&gt; Postman\n\n    Postman --&gt; Newman\n    Newman --&gt; BugReport\n    Newman --&gt; CICD\n\n    %% Audit tracking flow\n    Generator -.-&gt; AuditLog\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="7ypD47S2itXXyqVyT5ln-1">
